# john_wick_pro 1.02 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 35 of its 37 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# a tilted ball and three balls to the game's end; events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_start, bonus_end, tilt_warning, tilt, game_over.
# Shots no press made: Left outlane, Right outlane.

game           john_wick_pro
version        1.02

